71
00:06:18,378 --> 00:06:22,225
required main branch workflow. We will return to its result after the

72
00:06:22,225 --> 00:06:26,071
cloud and monitoring demonstration.

73
00:06:27,144 --> 00:06:31,118
We now check the workflow triggered by the live push. The status

74
00:06:31,118 --> 00:06:35,092
below comes directly from GitHub. Publication is allowed only after every required

75
00:06:35,092 --> 00:06:39,067
test, scan, deployment, and browser job passes.

76
00:07:07,144 --> 00:07:10,990
The workflow triggered by the recorded push completed successfully. Both native architectures

77
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:14,836
passed their build, Trivy scan, Kubernetes deployment, and browser checks. The publish

78
00:07:14,836 --> 00:07:18,682
job then released both images and updated GitOps. This result comes from

79
00:07:18,682 --> 00:07:22,528
